TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions 1:1, heat 20 to 200C, allow calcite
SOLUTION 1 DIC50
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca50
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp ionic_strength
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, IONIC_STRENGTH
END
SAVE solution 1
